program	while_let_value_position_refused.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	a `while let` loop produces no value and cannot be used as an expression
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: a `while let` loop produces no value and cannot be used as an expression"
log	"  --> examples/while_let_value_position_refused.saw:18:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 18 |     let r = while let x = opt(n) { n = n + 1 }"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: drain into a binding declared before the loop (`var out = ...` / `out.push(x)`), or use `for x in ...` when the source is an iterator"
log	""
log	"error: undefined variable `r`"
log	"  --> examples/while_let_value_position_refused.saw:19:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 19 |     print(\"{r}\")"
log	"     |             ^"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
